silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#tartucliniccompletesystem a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#tartucliniccompletesystem" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#tartucliniccompletesystem silm:hasLongDescription "The TartuClinicCompleteSystem is TartuClinicCompleteSystem: the complete Tartu Animal Clinic record and publication system that simultaneously enforces the five spine theorems (monad algebra, twelve-leg cocone, four-gate publish law, multi-view rendering contract, sous observation boundary)." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#monadalgebracontract a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#monadalgebracontract" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#monadalgebracontract silm:hasLongDescription "The MonadAlgebraContract is MonadAlgebraContract: the Tartu Clinic's monad algebra structure (ingest unit, publish multiplication, bind associativity) that makes the EncyclopediaEntry type a free-monad algebra. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'T1_FreeMonadThesis', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#twelvelegmittenssystem a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#twelvelegmittenssystem" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#twelvelegmittenssystem silm:hasLongDescription "The TwelveLegMittensSystem is TwelveLegMittensSystem: the Tartu Clinic's twelve-typed-observation system for Mittens (VetRecord_77, MicrochipID_44, BodyMassQuality, WeightMeas_3450g, Value_3450, Unit_grams, PetRole, SleepProcess_7h, SHACLPassReport_77, AuditTrail_77, DomesticCat, FelisCatusTSN183798)." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#clinicfourgatepublicationpipeline a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#clinicfourgatepublicationpipeline" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#clinicfourgatepublicationpipeline silm:hasLongDescription "The ClinicFourGatePublicationPipeline is ClinicFourGatePublicationPipeline: the Tartu Clinic's publication pipeline enforcing ingest, type, validate, render in order for every claim. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'T3_NodeOrArrowGate', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#clinicmultiviewrenderingcontract a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#clinicmultiviewrenderingcontract" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#clinicmultiviewrenderingcontract silm:hasLongDescription "The ClinicMultiViewRenderingContract is ClinicMultiViewRenderingContract: the Tartu Clinic's requirement that every published patient record appear in at least formal (HL7 data), diagram (PDF table), and reader (patient summary) views. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'T4_MultiViewAgreement', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#clinicsousobservationboundary a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#clinicsousobservationboundary" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#clinicsousobservationboundary silm:hasLongDescription "The ClinicSousObservationBoundary is ClinicSousObservationBoundary: the Tartu Clinic's audit role that reads both the incoming profile (all observations that attach to Mittens's record) and the outgoing profile (all downstream documents that reference Mittens's record) without replacing any of them." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#cheeseviolation_mittensequalscatus a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#cheeseviolation_mittensequalscatus" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#cheeseviolation_mittensequalscatus silm:hasLongDescription "The CheeseViolation_MittensEqualsCatus is CheeseViolation_MittensEqualsCatus: the forbidden collapse where the species type DomesticCat (or its ITIS name Felis catus) is used as if it were the identity of the individual Mittens-the-cat; closed by T2." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#cheeseviolation_renderequalsvalidation a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#cheeseviolation_renderequalsvalidation" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#cheeseviolation_renderequalsvalidation silm:hasLongDescription "The CheeseViolation_RenderEqualsValidation is CheeseViolation_RenderEqualsValidation: the forbidden collapse where the rendered PDF VetCarePlanPDF_77 is cited as the validation receipt SHACLPassReport_77; closed by T3. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Face_7', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#spinetokggrowth_15 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.00_whitepaper.sections.06_closure.concrete_anchor#spinetokggrowth_15" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#spinetokggrowth_15 silm:hasLongDescription "The SpineToKGGrowth_15 is SpineToKGGrowth_15: the spine-inheritance arrow from SpineColimit to paper 15 (knowledge graph growth around Mittens), transporting the closure guarantee for all ten cheese-trap faces. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'DownstreamInheritanceArrow', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
